solutions.latex:
The domain of $g(x)=\sqrt{7-x}$ requires $7-x\ge0$, so $x\le7$. Hence the domain of $y=f(g(x))$ is $x\le7$.
$$\begin{aligned} f(g(x))&=\left(\sqrt{7-x}\right)^2-2 \\ &=7-x-2 \\ &=5-x \end{aligned}$$
